{
    "comment": "글 작성 폼의 입력 칸 전부(글쓴이·분류·제목·본문과 공지·비밀 같은 스위치)를 한 카드에 담는다. 본문 편집기는 확장점이라 위지윅 플러그인이 깔려 있으면 그것으로 갈리고, 없으면 기본 편집기가 선다",
    "meta": {
        "is_partial": true,
        "description": "Post Form - All Form Fields in One Card"
    },
    "id": "post_form_fields",
    "type": "basic",
    "name": "Div",
    "classMap": {
        "key": "{{_computed.isReadOnly ? 'readonly' : 'normal'}}",
        "variants": {
            "readonly": "opacity-60",
            "normal": ""
        }
    },
    "children": [
        {
            "id": "main_form_card",
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "Div",
            "props": {
                "className": "admin-card"
            },
            "children": [
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "row-stack"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "id": "author_section",
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "if": "{{route?.id && form_meta?.data?.author}}",
                            "props": {
                                "className": ""
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Div",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "grid-2col-responsive"
                                    },
                                    "children": [
                                        {
                                            "id": "field_author_name",
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Div",
                                            "children": [
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Label",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "className": "text-label-subtle block font-medium mb-1"
                                                    },
                                                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-board.admin.posts.form.author_info"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Div",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "className": "flex-center gap-2"
                                                    },
                                                    "children": [
                                                        {
                                                            "type": "basic",
                                                            "name": "Span",
                                                            "props": {
                                                                "className": "text-heading"
                                                            },
                                                            "text": "{{form_meta?.data?.author?.email ? form_meta.data.author.name + ' (' + form_meta.data.author.email + ')' : form_meta?.data?.author?.name}}"
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "type": "basic",
                                                            "name": "Span",
                                                            "if": "{{form_meta?.data?.author?.is_guest}}",
                                                            "props": {
                                                                "className": "inline-flex items-center px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-medium bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 dark:bg-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300"
                                                            },
                                                            "text": "$t:sirsoft-board.admin.posts.guest"
                                                        }
                                                    ]
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "field_created_at",
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Div",
                                            "children": [
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Label",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "className": "text-label-subtle block font-medium mb-1"
                                                    },
                                                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-board.admin.posts.form.created_at"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Div",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "className": "flex-center gap-2 text-heading"
                                                    },
                                                    "children": [
                                                        {
                                                            "type": "basic",
                                                            "name": "Span",
                                                            "text": "{{form_meta?.data?.created_at}}"
                                                        }
                                                    ]
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "post_options_section",
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "if": "{{form_meta?.data?.board?.user_abilities?.can_write_notice || form_meta?.data?.board?.secret_mode !== 'disabled'}}",
                            "props": {
                                "className": ""
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "H3",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "text-label-subtle font-medium mb-3"
                                    },
                                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-board.admin.posts.form.post_options"
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Div",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "grid-2col-responsive"
                                    },
                                    "children": [
                                        {
                                            "id": "notice_card",
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Label",
                                            "if": "{{!_local.form?.parent_id}}",
                                            "props": {
                                                "disabled": "{{_computed.isReadOnly || !form_meta?.data?.board?.user_abilities?.can_write_notice}}",
                                                "className": "bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-lg p-4 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 cursor-pointer hover:border-blue-400 dark:hover:border-blue-600 transition-colors"
                                            },
                                            "children": [
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Div",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "className": "flex-start gap-3"
                                                    },
                                                    "children": [
                                                        {
                                                            "type": "basic",
                                                            "name": "Input",
                                                            "props": {
                                                                "type": "checkbox",
                                                                "name": "is_notice",
                                                                "disabled": "{{_computed.isReadOnly || !form_meta?.data?.board?.user_abilities?.can_write_notice}}",
                                                                "className": "mt-0.5 w-4 h-4 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 rounded dark:focus:ring-blue-600 dark:ring-offset-gray-800"
                                                            }
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "type": "basic",
                                                            "name": "Div",
                                                            "props": {
                                                                "className": "flex-1"
                                                            },
                                                            "children": [
                                                                {
                                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                                    "name": "Div",
                                                                    "props": {
                                                                        "className": "flex-center gap-2 mb-1"
                                                                    },
                                                                    "children": [
                                                                        {
                                                                            "type": "basic",
                                                                            "name": "Icon",
                                                                            "props": {
                                                                                "name": "bullhorn",
                                                                                "className": "text-base text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400"
                                                                            }
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            "type": "basic",
                                                                            "name": "Span",
                                                                            "props": {
                                                                                "className": "text-primary text-sm font-semibold"
                                                                            },
                                                                            "text": "$t:sirsoft-board.admin.posts.form.is_notice"
                                                                        }
                                                                    ]
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                                    "name": "P",
                                                                    "props": {
                                                                        "className": "text-tertiary"
                                                                    },
                                                                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-board.admin.posts.form.notice_description"
                                                                }
                                                            ]
                                                        }
                                                    ]
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "secret_card",
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Label",
                                            "if": "{{form_meta?.data?.board?.secret_mode !== 'disabled'}}",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-lg p-4 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 cursor-pointer board-secret-card transition-colors"
                                            },
                                            "children": [
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Div",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "className": "flex-start gap-3"
                                                    },
                                                    "children": [
                                                        {
                                                            "type": "basic",
                                                            "name": "Input",
                                                            "props": {
                                                                "type": "checkbox",
                                                                "name": "is_secret",
                                                                "disabled": "{{_computed.isReadOnly || form_meta?.data?.board?.secret_mode === 'always'}}",
                                                                "className": "mt-0.5 w-4 h-4 text-amber-600 rounded focus:ring-amber-500 dark:focus:ring-amber-600 dark:ring-offset-gray-800 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed"
                                                            }
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "type": "basic",
                                                            "name": "Div",
                                                            "props": {
                                                                "className": "flex-1"
                                                            },
                                                            "children": [
                                                                {
                                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                                    "name": "Div",
                                                                    "props": {
                                                                        "className": "flex-center gap-2 mb-1"
                                                                    },
                                                                    "children": [
                                                                        {
                                                                            "type": "basic",
                                                                            "name": "Icon",
                                                                            "props": {
                                                                                "name": "lock",
                                                                                "className": "text-base text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400"
                                                                            }
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            "type": "basic",
                                                                            "name": "Span",
                                                                            "props": {
                                                                                "className": "text-primary text-sm font-semibold"
                                                                            },
                                                                            "text": "$t:sirsoft-board.admin.posts.form.is_secret"
                                                                        }
                                                                    ]
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                                    "name": "P",
                                                                    "props": {
                                                                        "className": "text-tertiary"
                                                                    },
                                                                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-board.admin.posts.form.secret_description"
                                                                }
                                                            ]
                                                        }
                                                    ]
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "id": "category_section",
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "if": "{{form_meta?.data?.board?.categories && form_meta.data.board.categories.length > 0}}",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "pb-6"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Label",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "form-label"
                            },
                            "text": "$t:sirsoft-board.admin.posts.form.category"
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Select",
                            "props": {
                                "name": "category",
                                "value": "{{_local.form?.category ?? ''}}",
                                "disabled": "{{_computed.isReadOnly || !!_local.form?.parent_id}}",
                                "className": "text-primary block w-full board-category-select rounded-lg border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 px-3 py-2 focus:border-blue-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-blue-500 dark:focus:ring-blue-400 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Option",
                                    "props": {
                                        "value": ""
                                    },
                                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-board.admin.posts.form.select_category"
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Option",
                                    "iteration": {
                                        "source": "form_meta?.data?.board?.categories ?? []",
                                        "item_var": "category"
                                    },
                                    "props": {
                                        "value": "{{category}}"
                                    },
                                    "text": "{{category}}"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "row-stack"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "id": "title_section",
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "props": {
                                "className": ""
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Div",
                                    "children": [
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Label",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "text-label-subtle block font-medium"
                                            },
                                            "text": "$t:sirsoft-board.admin.posts.form.title"
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Input",
                                            "props": {
                                                "type": "text",
                                                "name": "title",
                                                "value": "{{_local.form?.title ?? ''}}",
                                                "disabled": "{{_computed.isReadOnly}}",
                                                "placeholder": "$t:sirsoft-board.admin.posts.form.title_placeholder",
                                                "className": "block focus:ring-1 dark:focus:ring-blue-400"
                                            }
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "content_section",
                            "type": "extension_point",
                            "name": "html_editor",
                            "props": {
                                "placeholder": "$t:sirsoft-board.admin.posts.form.content_placeholder",
                                "label": "$t:sirsoft-board.admin.posts.form.content",
                                "rows": 15,
                                "showHtmlModeToggle": true,
                                "name": "content"
                            },
                            "default": [
                                {
                                    "type": "composite",
                                    "name": "HtmlEditor",
                                    "actions": [
                                        {
                                            "comment": "본문 글자를 담는다 — 편집기는 폼 자동 바인딩을 타지 않아 여기서 직접 넣고, 「변경 있음」도 함께 켠다",
                                            "type": "change",
                                            "event": "onChange",
                                            "handler": "setState",
                                            "params": {
                                                "target": "local",
                                                "hasChanges": true,
                                                "form": {
                                                    "content": "{{$args[0].target.value}}"
                                                }
                                            }
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "comment": "HTML 모드 토글 — 글자와 따로 저장되는 값이라 이벤트도 따로 받는다. 켜짐/꺼짐(boolean)을 그대로 두지 않고 `html`·`text` 문자열로 바꿔 담는 것은 서버가 그 두 값으로 본문 해석을 가르기 때문이다",
                                            "type": "change",
                                            "event": "onIsHtmlChange",
                                            "handler": "setState",
                                            "params": {
                                                "target": "local",
                                                "hasChanges": true,
                                                "form": {
                                                    "content_mode": "{{$args[0].target.checked ? 'html' : 'text'}}"
                                                }
                                            }
                                        }
                                    ],
                                    "props": {
                                        "name": "content",
                                        "content": "{{_local.form?.content ?? ''}}",
                                        "isHtml": "{{(_local.form?.content_mode ?? 'text') === 'html'}}",
                                        "disabled": "{{_computed.isReadOnly}}",
                                        "readOnly": "{{_computed.isReadOnly}}",
                                        "rows": 15,
                                        "placeholder": "$t:sirsoft-board.admin.posts.form.content_placeholder",
                                        "label": "$t:sirsoft-board.admin.posts.form.content",
                                        "showHtmlModeToggle": true
                                    }
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}
